                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Uwiteka Nyiringabo ararahiye ati “Ni ukuri uko nabitekereje ni ko bizasohora, kandi uko nagambiriye ni ko bizaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzavunagurira Abashuri mu gihugu cyanjye, kandi nzabaribatira mu misozi yanjye miremire, maze uburetwa babakoreshaga buzabavaho, n'umutwaro babahekeshaga uzabava ku bitugu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo ni wo mugambi wagiriwe isi yose, kandi uko ni ko kuboko kwaramburiwe amahanga yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubwo Uwiteka Nyiringabo ari we wabigambiriye ni nde uzamuvuguruza? Ukuboko kwe kurabanguye, ni nde uzaguhina?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        }
