        {
          "text": " Bufilisitiya mwese, ntimunezezwe ni uko inkoni yabakubitaga ivunitse, kuko mu gishyitsi cy'inzoka hagiye kuvamo incira, kandi urubyaro rwayo ruzaba inzoka iguruka y'ubumara butwika. 2.4-7; Zek 9.5-7 ",
          "type": "text",
